^NAME +ARCH +STATUS +PODS +ROLE$
^node-b +wasm32 +Ready +0 +[a-z-]+$
^test +wasm32 +Ready +0 +[a-z-]+$
^deployment/spread created$
^spread-[0-9] +[01]/1 +Running +0 +1 +[0-9]+s +node-b$
^spread-[0-9] +[01]/1 +Running +0 +1 +[0-9]+s +test$
^deployment/pinned created$
^pinned-1 +[01]/1 +Running +0 +1 +[0-9]+s +node-b$
^kube: pinned-1 runs on node-b; its logs stay on that machine$
^node-b +wasm32 +NotReady +0 +-$
^test +wasm32 +Ready +4 +leader$
^spread-[5-9] +1/1 +Running +0 +1 +[0-9]+s +test$
^pinned-2 +0/1 +Unschedulable +0 +1 +[0-9]+s +-$
^  [0-9]+s +Removed pod spread-[0-9] \(node node-b is gone\)$
^deployment/spread deleted$
